# World Pulse — Publisher discovery catalog

The domains below are used as **discovery filters** with Google News RSS. World Pulse does not fetch full article pages or poll the publishers' own RSS feeds. A publisher appearing here does not grant a right to reproduce or process its content commercially. The program skips identifiable results from providers with known restrictive terms unless permission is obtained.

## 1. Politics
- Arabic: Al Jazeera (`aljazeera.net`, rights-gated), Al Arabiya (`alarabiya.net`), Sky News Arabia (`skynewsarabia.com`), Asharq Al-Awsat (`aawsat.com`), Al-Quds Al-Arabi (`alquds.co.uk`).
- English: Reuters (`reuters.com`, rights-gated), Associated Press (`apnews.com`, rights-gated), Politico (`politico.com`), BBC (`bbc.com`, rights-gated).

