## Rights-gated sources
The current blocklist skips identifiable results from BBC, Reuters, AP News, TechCrunch, ESPN, ScienceDaily, The Guardian and Al Jazeera. They are left in this catalog for visibility and for future use if World Pulse obtains an appropriate licence or written permission. The exact scope of publisher permissions differs by service and jurisdiction; verify the current terms before changing the gate.
